                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>Are UGC rights worth paying extra for?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes — worth 50-100% of base fee. Enables paid re-use in ads + owned channels. Contracts without UGC rights waste 50% of creator investment.</p>
                                        <h3>What is ASCI compliance requirement?</h3>
                                        <p>Clear #ad or #sponsored disclosure on paid promotional content. Prominent + visible + across all formats (posts + stories + videos).</p>
                                        <h3>Should I require category exclusivity?</h3>
                                        <p>For meaningful investments: yes. 60-180 days typical. Higher fees justify longer exclusivity. Enforcement + monitoring essential.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the biggest influencer contract mistake?</h3>
                                        <p>Missing UGC rights + no exclusivity + weak disclosure enforcement. All three erode 40-60% of program value.</p>
